---
import "../../styles/global.css";
import { ClientRouter } from 'astro:transitions';
---

<html lang="es">
  <head>
    <meta charset="utf-8" />
    <link rel="icon" type="image/svg+xml" href="/favicon.svg" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width" />
    <title>Appointment Management API | Miller Arias</title>
    <ClientRouter />
  </head>
  <body class="bg-neutral-950 text-neutral-50 min-h-screen p-6 md:p-16 font-sans selection:bg-purple-500 selection:text-white">
    
    <main class="max-w-3xl mx-auto project-layout" transition:name="card-project-appointment">
      
      <a href="/" class="back-btn inline-flex items-center gap-2 text-sm font-mono text-neutral-500 hover:text-purple-400 transition-colors group">
        <span class="inline-block transform group-hover:-translate-x-1 transition-transform">←</span> 
        Volver al bento
      </a>

      <header class="project-header">
        <div class="flex flex-wrap items-center gap-3 mb-4">
          <span class="px-3 py-1 bg-purple-500/10 border border-purple-500/20 text-purple-400 text-xs font-mono rounded-full uppercase tracking-wider">
            Full Stack Enterprise
          </span>
          <span class="px-3 py-1 bg-neutral-900 border border-neutral-800 text-neutral-400 text-xs font-mono rounded-full">
            Decoupled Architecture
          </span>
        </div>
        <h1 class="text-3xl md:text-5xl font-bold tracking-tight text-neutral-100 mb-6">
          Appointment Management API
        </h1>
        <p class="text-neutral-400 text-lg leading-relaxed">
          Sistema robusto de agendamiento y gestión de citas clínicas. Diseñado mediante un backend corporativo con validación estricta de esquemas relacionales y un cliente SPA modular de alto rendimiento.
        </p>

        <div class="mt-6">
          <a href="https://github.com/Miller1999/Bookly" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 text-xs font-mono bg-neutral-900 text-neutral-300 hover:text-white border border-neutral-800 hover:border-neutral-700 px-4 py-2 rounded-xl transition-all">
            <span>Ver Repositorio en GitHub</span>
            <span class="text-neutral-600">↗</span>
          </a>
        </div>
      </header>

      <hr class="border-neutral-900 my-12" />

      <section class="section-block">
        <h2 class="text-xs font-mono text-neutral-500 uppercase tracking-wider mb-6">Topología de la Arquitectura</h2>
        
        <div class="bg-neutral-900/30 border border-neutral-900 rounded-2xl p-6 font-mono text-xs relative overflow-hidden">
          <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-3 gap-6 text-center relative z-10">
            
            <div class="p-4 bg-neutral-900/60 rounded-xl border border-neutral-800/60 flex flex-col justify-between">
              <div>
                <span class="text-[10px] text-cyan-400 uppercase tracking-widest block mb-1">Presentation Layer</span>
                <p class="text-neutral-200 font-bold text-sm">React 18 + Vite</p>
              </div>
              <p class="text-neutral-500 text-[11px] mt-3">SPA Tipada con TypeScript, Axios para consumo HTTP y Tailwind CSS.</p>
            </div>

            <div class="p-4 bg-neutral-900/60 rounded-xl border border-purple-500/20 flex flex-col justify-between relative">
              <div class="absolute -top-2 left-1/2 transform -translate-x-1/2 px-2 py-0.5 bg-purple-500/20 text-purple-400 text-[9px] uppercase rounded border border-purple-500/30">RESTful</div>
              <div>
                <span class="text-[10px] text-purple-400 uppercase tracking-widest block mb-1">Core Logic</span>
                <p class="text-neutral-200 font-bold text-sm">ASP.NET Core 8</p>
              </div>
              <p class="text-neutral-500 text-[11px] mt-3">Validación a nivel de modelo, inyección de dependencias y ruteo asíncrono.</p>
            </div>

            <div class="p-4 bg-neutral-900/60 rounded-xl border border-neutral-800/60 flex flex-col justify-between">
              <div>
                <span class="text-[10px] text-emerald-400 uppercase tracking-widest block mb-1">Data Storage</span>
                <p class="text-neutral-200 font-bold text-sm">PostgreSQL + EF Core</p>
              </div>
              <p class="text-neutral-500 text-[11px] mt-3">Mapeo Objeto-Relacional (ORM) automatizado mediante migraciones estrictas.</p>
            </div>

          </div>
        </div>
      </section>

      <section class="section-block">
        <h2 class="text-xs font-mono text-neutral-500 uppercase tracking-wider mb-4">Matriz de Endpoints (REST API)</h2>
        <div class="bg-neutral-900 rounded-2xl border border-neutral-800 overflow-hidden">
          <div class="p-4 bg-neutral-950 border-b border-neutral-800 flex items-center justify-between">
            <span class="text-xs font-mono text-neutral-400">Controlador base: <code class="text-purple-400">/api/appointments</code></span>
            <span class="text-[10px] bg-neutral-900 px-2 py-0.5 border border-neutral-800 rounded text-neutral-500 font-mono">Swagger UI Compliant</span>
          </div>
          <div class="p-6 overflow-x-auto">
            <table class="w-full text-left font-mono text-xs text-neutral-400 min-w-[500px]">
              <thead>
                <tr class="border-b border-neutral-800 text-neutral-500">
                  <th class="pb-2 font-normal w-24">Método</th>
                  <th class="pb-2 font-normal">Ruta del Endpoint</th>
                  <th class="pb-2 font-normal">Operación / Impacto</th>
                </tr>
              </thead>
              <tbody>
                <tr class="border-b border-neutral-800/50">
                  <td class="py-3 font-bold text-emerald-400">GET</td>
                  <td class="py-3 text-neutral-200">/api/appointments</td>
                  <td class="py-3 text-neutral-500">Listado completo con paginación integrada.</td>
                </tr>
                <tr class="border-b border-neutral-800/50">
                  <td class="py-3 font-bold text-emerald-400">GET</td>
                  <td class="py-3 text-neutral-200">/api/appointments/{"id"}</td>
                  <td class="py-3 text-neutral-500">Búsqueda atómica por ID único en base relacional.</td>
                </tr>
                <tr class="border-b border-neutral-800/50">
                  <td class="py-3 font-bold text-blue-400">POST</td>
                  <td class="py-3 text-neutral-200">/api/appointments</td>
                  <td class="py-3 text-neutral-500">Creación e inserción con validación asíncrona.</td>
                </tr>
                <tr class="border-b border-neutral-800/50">
                  <td class="py-3 font-bold text-amber-400">PUT</td>
                  <td class="py-3 text-neutral-200">/api/appointments/{"id"}</td>
                  <td class="py-3 text-neutral-500">Mutación completa de datos de la cita y estados.</td>
                </tr>
                <tr>
                  <td class="py-3 font-bold text-red-400">DELETE</td>
                  <td class="py-3 text-neutral-200">/api/appointments/{"id"}</td>
                  <td class="py-3 text-neutral-500">Remoción física del registro mediante Entity Framework.</td>
                </tr>
              </tbody>
            </table>
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>

      <section class="section-block">
  <h2 class="text-xs font-mono text-neutral-500 uppercase tracking-wider mb-4">Contrato de Datos (Esquema JSON)</h2>
  <p class="text-neutral-400 text-sm mb-4 leading-relaxed">
    Garantía de integridad de ciclo de vida para los estados transaccionales permitidos (<code class="text-xs bg-neutral-900 px-1.5 py-0.5 rounded text-neutral-300">pendiente</code>, <code class="text-xs bg-neutral-900 px-1.5 py-0.5 rounded text-neutral-300">confirmada</code>, <code class="text-xs bg-neutral-900 px-1.5 py-0.5 rounded text-neutral-300">cancelada</code>).
  </p>

  <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-4 font-mono text-xs">
    <div class="bg-neutral-900 p-5 rounded-2xl border border-neutral-800">
      <span class="text-[10px] text-neutral-500 uppercase block mb-3">// HTTP POST Body</span>
      <pre class="text-neutral-300"><code>{"{"}
  <span class="text-purple-400">"clientName"</span>: <span class="text-cyan-400">"John Doe"</span>,
  <span class="text-purple-400">"date"</span>: <span class="text-cyan-400">"2024-12-01T10:00:00"</span>,
  <span class="text-purple-400">"status"</span>: <span class="text-cyan-400">"pendiente"</span>
{"}"}</code></pre>
    </div>

    <div class="bg-neutral-900 p-5 rounded-2xl border border-neutral-800">
      <span class="text-[10px] text-neutral-500 uppercase block mb-3">// HTTP 201 Created Response</span>
      <pre class="text-neutral-300"><code>{"{"}
  <span class="text-purple-400">"id"</span>: <span class="text-orange-400">1</span>,
  <span class="text-purple-400">"clientName"</span>: <span class="text-cyan-400">"John Doe"</span>,
  <span class="text-purple-400">"date"</span>: <span class="text-cyan-400">"2024-12-01T10:00:00"</span>,
  <span class="text-purple-400">"status"</span>: <span class="text-cyan-400">"pendiente"</span>,
  <span class="text-purple-400">"createdAt"</span>: <span class="text-neutral-500">"2024-10-03..."</span>
{"}"}</code></pre>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

      <section class="section-block">
        <h2 class="text-xs font-mono text-neutral-500 uppercase tracking-wider mb-6">Estrategia de Desarrollo & Control de Calidad</h2>
        <div class="space-y-6">
          
          <div class="bg-neutral-900/40 border border-neutral-900 p-5 rounded-2xl">
            <h3 class="text-sm font-mono text-purple-400 uppercase tracking-wider mb-2">Validación Dual (Client & Server Side)</h3>
            <p class="text-neutral-400 text-sm leading-relaxed">
              La consistencia de los datos está blindada perimetralmente. El frontend intercepta cadenas vacías o fechas inválidas antes de consumir red, mientras que el backend ejecuta filtros estrictos mediante <strong>Data Annotations</strong> nativas de C#, evitando corrupciones o payloads maliciosos directo en la base PostgreSQL.
            </p>
          </div>

          <div class="bg-neutral-900/40 border border-neutral-900 p-5 rounded-2xl">
            <h3 class="text-sm font-mono text-emerald-400 uppercase tracking-wider mb-2">Eficiencia en Volumen: Paginación Nativa</h3>
            <p class="text-neutral-400 text-sm leading-relaxed">
              En lugar de saturar la memoria RAM del cliente transmitiendo cientos de registros simultáneos, el controlador expone parámetros numéricos de paginación que segmentan la respuesta a nivel de base de datos gracias a las directivas de filtrado diferido en <strong>LINQ / Entity Framework Core</strong>.
            </p>
          </div>

        </div>
      </section>

      <footer class="project-footer text-center">
        <p class="text-xs font-mono text-neutral-700">
          Miller Arias • Detalle Técnico del Proyecto • 2026
        </p>
      </footer>

    </main>
  </body>
</html>

<style>
  /* Clases de espaciado inmutables e inmunes a colapsos */
  .project-layout {
    margin-top: 4rem;
  }
  .back-btn {
    margin-bottom: 3.5rem !important;
  }
  .project-header {
    margin-bottom: 3rem !important;
  }
  .section-block {
    margin-bottom: 5.5rem !important;
  }
  .project-footer {
    margin-top: 6rem;
    padding-top: 2rem;
    border-top: 1px solid #171717;
  }

  /* Control responsivo para el viewport */
  @media (min-width: 768px) {
    .project-layout {
      margin-top: 6rem;
    }
  }
</style>